        "id": 77131,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-14T22:56:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>While AFL has the opposite effect on me (though not as pronouncedly as Bunker, who to me is the absolute epitome of “I have other options but none of them actually matter”, and thus ranks lower for me than Ra).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I guess we just disagree here. I think Bunker has a lot choices and decisions, and it is oftem difficult to decide between them.</p>",
