      {
        "id": 77132,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-14T23:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only way I ever don't end up going Turret Mode + at least one of Flak Cannon and Grenade Launcher (perhaps with Omni-Cannon or Maintenance Unit as the other power) is if I never draw one or the other, or if the guns are destroyed before I get a chance to play Turret Mode.&nbsp; None of his other options are worthwhile by comparison, though throwing in a Gatling Gun is a nice bonus if you have a huge enough pile of cards.&nbsp; I did recently get the chance to fire his Omni-Cannon for the first time, and had ignored two Turret Modes the whole game, but only because I never had a Flak Cannon, and when I had the Grenade Launcher there was only one target out.</p>",
