      {
        "id": 77133,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-14T23:28:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Adhesive Foam Grenade is an amazing card in certain Environments, e.g. Rook City, Megalopolis, Pike Industrial Complex. And the Omnicannon is good in certain situations, like when you absolutely need to kill someone who's providing everyone DR or is immune to projectile damage.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:01.949Z",
