      {
        "id": 77134,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-14T23:35:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Adhesive Foam Grenade is an amazing card in certain Environments</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh, I'm not discounting that one, it's great - but it's just a one-shot, and playing it earlier in the game before the turret setup comes together doesn't change the fact that your overall game plan is to get the turret setup.&nbsp; Since Bunker has no tutoring and his card-drawing mostly comes from his power (the only exception being Recharge Mode), he can easily play a few extra cards without affecting his main strategy.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And the Omnicannon is good in certain situations, like when you absolutely need to kill someone who's providing everyone DR or is immune to projectile damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>True, it has its possibilities, but it's so slow to get it running, and trying to charge it for multiple turns in a row is a terrifying risk if the enemy has any surprises at all up their sleeve.&nbsp; The one time I got to fire it for 12, it was against Cosmic Omnitron and I knew that his two Tech Sings were done with - even so, I counted all the Drones and Terraformings in his deck, hedged against the one Stout Barrel left in the environment, and would not have tried to store cards for a full round if there was even a chance that Omnitron could have reshuffled and TechSinged me.&nbsp; Only the ability to know the villain intimately and metagame around it made it a viable strategy, and I don't really like playing that way, as it breaks SOD.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:02.028Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
