      {
        "id": 77136,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-15T00:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also, I am not clear on what you mean when you say Omni or Maintenance for the other power. Unless you have an Aux Power Unit, Flak Cannon and Grenade Launcher will almost always be better and it is not worth wasting turns playing the other ones.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They're if you don't have one or both of the \"main guns\".&nbsp; My whole point was that if you do have the \"main guns\" and Turret Mode, nothing else matters much.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For sure not Maintenance</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If tanking with Heavy Plating and lacking a gun, Maint Unit regenerates you so you can continue to take the hits.&nbsp; (Since he's \"The Indestructible Bunker\", I think he should have been better at this than he is, and not relied so much on guns.)&nbsp; Also if you have a gun but don't always find targets for it (eg Miss Information), it might be useful to go into Turret mode just to heal 4 every turn, since Maint Unit isn't Limited.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:58:02.161Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
